Publishes the name of each Wayland output, such as "DP-1", as a property of its display, since the name that SDL gives a display is the description or the model of the monitor, which two monitors of one model share.

--- a/include/SDL3/SDL_video.h
+++ b/include/SDL3/SDL_video.h
@@ -665,6 +665,8 @@
  *
