  *   with the display
+ * - `SDL_PROP_DISPLAY_WAYLAND_WL_OUTPUT_NAME_STRING`: the name of the
+ *   wl_output, such as "DP-1", where the compositor names its outputs
  *
  * On Windows:
  *
@@ -684,6 +686,7 @@
